OL,3,AA&E warning system to flag sick
OL,4,Achildren deteriorating quickly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high overall score means a child
OL,7,Fneeds more urgent attention. Concerns
OL,8,Ffrom staff, parents, carers or the
OL,9,Fchild themselves will trigger an
OL,10,Fimmediate escalation of care.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
