OL,3,ANine killed as small jet crashes on
OL,4,AFlorida street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aircraft had departed from Austin,
OL,7,FTexas, and was headed to the Bahamas,
OL,8,Fthe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,9,F(FAA) said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
